{"meta": {"family": "multicol"}, "regions": [{"id": "multicol-2/title", "bbox": [40.0, 24.0, 984.0, 64.0], "text": "Controller Family Hardware Specification - Chapter 6", "role": "title", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/col0", "bbox": [40.0, 90.0, 497.0, 1000.0], "text": "", "role": "container", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s1h", "bbox": [40.0, 90.0, 497.0, 118.0], "text": "6.1 QS-5 Bus Interface", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s1p", "bbox": [40.0, 122.0, 497.0, 194.0], "text": "The QS-5 SPI bus clock is limited to 52 MHz; CRC errors above 71 per hour raise a fault.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s2h", "bbox": [40.0, 220.0, 497.0, 248.0], "text": "6.2 QS-5 Firmware Update", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s2p", "bbox": [40.0, 252.0, 497.0, 324.0], "text": "QS-5 firmware images are signed; rollback is blocked below version 89.42.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s3h", "bbox": [40.0, 350.0, 497.0, 378.0], "text": "6.3 QS-5 Thermal Management", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s3p", "bbox": [40.0, 382.0, 497.0, 454.0], "text": "The QS-5 thermal shutdown threshold is 75 C; fan speed ramps linearly from 13 C.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s4h", "bbox": [40.0, 480.0, 497.0, 508.0], "text": "6.4 QS-5 Power Sequencing", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s4p", "bbox": [40.0, 512.0, 497.0, 584.0], "text": "Rails of the QS-5 power up in order 3V3, 1V8, 0V9 with 24 ms spacing; brownout trips at 34 mV.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/col1", "bbox": [527.0, 90.0, 984.0, 1000.0], "text": "", "role": "container", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s5h", "bbox": [527.0, 90.0, 984.0, 118.0], "text": "6.5 PW-6 Thermal Management", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s5p", "bbox": [527.0, 122.0, 984.0, 194.0], "text": "The PW-6 thermal shutdown threshold is 15 C; fan speed ramps linearly from 28 C.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s6h", "bbox": [527.0, 220.0, 984.0, 248.0], "text": "6.6 PW-6 Firmware Update", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s6p", "bbox": [527.0, 252.0, 984.0, 324.0], "text": "PW-6 firmware images are signed; rollback is blocked below version 44.21.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s7h", "bbox": [527.0, 350.0, 984.0, 378.0], "text": "6.7 PW-6 Watchdog Timer", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s7p", "bbox": [527.0, 382.0, 984.0, 454.0], "text": "The PW-6 watchdog timeout is 114 ms; the window opens after 59 ms and a missed kick forces reset.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s8h", "bbox": [527.0, 480.0, 984.0, 508.0], "text": "6.8 PW-6 Power Sequencing", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-2/s8p", "bbox": [527.0, 512.0, 984.0, 584.0], "text": "Rails of the PW-6 power up in order 3V3, 1V8, 0V9 with 118 ms spacing; brownout trips at 91 mV.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-2/col1", "links": []}]}